3.4 The table (optional)
Not required for M1, but it costs four lines and gives the exact numbers behind the colours. Click a column header to sort.

oh_map |&gt;
  st_drop_geometry() |&gt;
  transmute(County = NAME, Observed = Y,
            Expected = round(E, 1), SIR = round(SIR, 2)) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(SIR)) |&gt;
  datatable(rownames = FALSE, options = list(pageLength = 10))
